Sure! Here's the translation of the given text into UVL-Code:

```uvl
features
	Factory {abstract}
		mandatory
			Production_Line {abstract}
				alternative
					Normal_Chocolate
						mandatory
							Melting_Station
							Mixing_Station
							Cooling_Station
					Nut_Chocolate
						mandatory
							Normal_Chocolate
							Baking_Station
				optional
					Logistic_System
					Packaging_Station
constraints
	Production_Line & Logistic_System
	Production_Line & Packaging_Station
```

This UVL code defines the features of a factory with a production line capable of producing both normal chocolate and nut-chocolate, including the necessary stations and optional systems.